@reranker/stats

Cited sites are grouped by registrable domain using the Public Suffix List
(https://publicsuffix.org), maintained by the Mozilla Foundation and contributors and
licensed under the Mozilla Public License 2.0 (https://mozilla.org/MPL/2.0/). The list is
read through tldts 7.5.4 (MIT, https://github.com/remusao/tldts), which embeds a snapshot
of it; the version is pinned in the workspace catalog, so a report is grouped the same way
until the pin moves. The list is used unmodified.
